{"ts":"2026-08-07T13:27:40.044Z","author":"codex","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"50e451cc0f2b325ca259444b","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-rl-zcqf"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Release gate omits operational scripts, full-history identities, lint, and duplication"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The configured exact coverage gate measures index.ts and series.ts only while three executable TypeScript scripts remain outside instrumentation. release:check has no raw Git object identity audit, and the reachable history currently contains two distinct non-GitHub-noreply addresses without printing their values. No explicit ESLint or jscpd-equivalent gate exists. Publishing must remain blocked until these independent quality and privacy contracts are implemented."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":0},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["coverage","docstrings","duplication","git-history","lint","privacy","release-blocker","typescript"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-07T13:27:40.044Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-07T13:27:40.044Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":720},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Every executable TypeScript file is instrumented at exact 100 percent for every supported coverage dimension with behavioral tests; ESLint enforces no explicit any, no inline or dynamic imports, erasable syntax, and package conventions; a strict duplicate-code gate runs; a raw physical commit and annotated-tag identity audit includes unreachable objects and permits only approved public identities; tracked files and full history pass secret and private-data scans; release:check and prepublishOnly fail closed on every gate"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/definition_of_ready","value":"Inventory emitted sources, operational scripts, all physical Git identities, maintained TypeScript lint tooling, and duplicate-code tooling without printing private values"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Makes pm-rl's release-readiness claims literal and privacy-preserving"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Prevents operational tooling, duplicated or forbidden code, and historical personal metadata from bypassing publication gates"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"One fail-closed release command proves all-source quality and full-history privacy"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"The 2026.8.7 compatibility audit proved the configured two-file gate but found three excluded scripts, two non-noreply history identities, and absent lint/duplication enforcement"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-rl-e20d"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reviewer","value":"maintainer"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"critical"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/sprint","value":"2026-08-quality"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/release","value":"Unreleased"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"critical"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/environment","value":"pm-rl 2026.7.31 public repository with Node 22/26 CI"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Inspect package.json coverageGate.sources and release:check, enumerate scripts/*.ts, and classify unique git author/committer addresses without emitting them"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"All executable TypeScript and the full physical Git history are covered by mandatory release gates"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Only index.ts and series.ts are instrumented; three scripts, raw-object identity privacy, lint, and duplication are ungated"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"quality/privacy"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/customer_impact","value":"A package could pass release:check while shipping untested operational logic or retaining unapproved personal history metadata"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-rl-soik","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-07T13:27:40.044Z","author":"codex","source_kind":"compatibility-audit","author_source":"asserted"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"9eceda26cebe3e09ec34326533348f6b360235cbd3dfa75143b47c3e029ef1ed","message":"Track exact all-source quality and full-history privacy gaps"}
